{'symbol': 'INFO', 'date': '2021-03-02 08:00:00', 'title': 'IHS MARKIT NAMES GENERAL MOTORS TOP MANUFACTURER FOR SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR IN ITS 25TH ANNUAL AUTOMOTIVE LOYALTY AWARDS', 'text': 'SOUTHFIELD, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #AUTOLOYALTY--IHS MARKIT ANNOUNCED THE RESULTS OF ITS 25TH ANNUAL AUTOMOTIVE LOYALTY AWARDS TODAY, RECOGNIZING GENERAL MOTORS AS TOP MANUFACTURER IN 2020.'}